# Licensing

This repository holds two different kinds of material, and they are licensed
separately. The terms below match what the site states at
https://chollimahunter.github.io/about/#reuse.

## Site content and data

The prose, the indicator datasets, the hunt library, the profiles, and every
other data file under `src/` and `docs/` are licensed under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt this material for any purpose, including commercially,
provided you give appropriate credit and link back to the page the material
came from. Indicators published here are marked TLP:CLEAR and may be shared
without restriction.

Two things this license does not and cannot do:

- It does not make a claim true. Every entry cites a primary source, and
  anyone reusing this material should verify the claim against that source
  rather than against this site.
- It does not cover the underlying records. Photographs of named individuals
  are reproduced from the law-enforcement notices that published them and
  remain subject to whatever terms apply to those originals. Quoted passages
  from vendor reports belong to their publishers. Where a data file carries a
  per-entry citation, that citation governs the underlying fact, not this
  license.

