## Corrections and removals

Licensing is separate from accuracy. Anyone who believes an entry is wrong,
unfairly sourced, or concerns an identity stolen from them can ask for it to
be corrected or removed, whatever the license says. See
https://chollimahunter.github.io/about/#corrections.
